<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/msa@/~cl_24__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "a" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/msa@> .
