<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/msa@/~cl_24__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "dalam nota bahu, dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan \"vokasional\" perkataan \" dan institusi pengajian tinggi swasta\";"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/msa@/~cl_24__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/msa@/~cl_24> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/msa@> .
