<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/msa@/~cl_37> <https://schema.org/text> "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memotong seksyen 31A, 31 B, 31c, 31D, 31E, 32, 33, 34, 35, 36, 36A, 37, 38, 39, 39A, 40 dan 40A. Pindaan seksyen 41B"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/msa@> .
